sox-14.4.2.tar.gz, unmodified (sha256
b45f598643ffbd8e363ff24d61166ccec4836fea6d3888881b8df53e3bb55f6c, from
https://downloads.sourceforge.net/project/sox/sox/14.4.2/sox-14.4.2.tar.gz).
